<title>PAKISTAN: Burshane Pakistan 1st half net 41 pct up.</title>
<headline>Burshane Pakistan 1st half net 41 pct up.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended December 31, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales			129 vs 112</p>
<p>    Profit before tax	 24 vs 15</p>
<p>    Profit after tax	  17 vs 12</p>
<p>    Interim dividend    40 pct vs 35 pct per 10-rupee share</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Burshane (Pakistan) Ltd. The company distributes liquefied petroleum gas. The company said it carried forward 24 million as unappropriated profit to the balance sheet. Book closure March 20-27. Ex-dividend date March 20.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
